 ```
 
+## API
+
+### parseMilliseconds(milliseconds, options?)
+
+Accepts a finite number or a bigint.
+
+#### options
+
+##### largestUnit
+
+Type: `'days' | 'hours' | 'minutes' | 'seconds'`\
+Default: `'days'`
+
+The largest unit to include. Bigger units roll into it.
+
+```js
+parseMilliseconds(93_600_000, {largestUnit: 'hours'});
+// {days: 0, hours: 26, minutes: 0, seconds: 0, …}
+```
+
+Throws a `TypeError` for any other value.
+
 ## Related
 
 - [to-milliseconds](https://github.com/sindresorhus/to-milliseconds) - The inverse of this module
